,"1hopcy",{"width":"18","height":"18","x":"3","y":"4","rx":"2"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],"$undefined"]}],"1 August 2026",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/25","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"BMB Renovation"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 sm:py-20 flex-grow bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["If you are researching kitchen fitting cost in London, the headline figure can be difficult to interpret. A small replacement kitchen may need only straightforward cabinet installation, while a larger renovation could involve rewiring, new plumbing, plastering, flooring and structural changes. As a rough UK guide, a modest fully fitted kitchen may typically start from around £8,000, while a more comprehensive mid-range renovation may fall around £15,000–£30,000. Larger or premium projects may exceed £30,000. Every kitchen project differs, so these are planning ranges only; request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Typical kitchen fitting costs by room size"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The size of the room affects both the number of units and the amount of labour. A compact galley kitchen may cost less overall, although restricted access can make installation slower. An open-plan or large kitchen can cost more where it includes additional cabinets, worktop, flooring, lighting and preparation. The following are rough typical UK budgeting ranges only. Every project differs, so obtain a free, no-obligation quote based on the room, specification and required work."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Small kitchen or galley layout: as a rough guide, typically around £8,000–£15,000 for a complete, straightforward renovation with mid-range units and standard finishes."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Medium kitchen: as a rough guide, typically around £15,000–£25,000 where there are more cabinets, appliances, worktop space and some alterations to services."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Large or open-plan kitchen: as a rough guide, typically around £25,000–£40,000 or more, particularly where walls are removed, flooring is extended or premium materials are selected."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Fitting-only projects: as a rough guide, labour may typically be around £3,000–£10,000, depending on the number of units, worktop type, appliances and preparation required. This may exclude the kitchen, appliances and finishing materials."]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Thinking about your own project?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation covers Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead and beyond — all trades in-house. Call +44 7775 758 717 or send us a message."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get a Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"What is included in the labour cost?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Kitchen fitting is more than fixing doors to cabinets. Labour may cover removing the existing kitchen, protecting surrounding areas, assembling and levelling units, fitting worktops, connecting appliances, installing sinks and taps, tiling, decorating and making good. Plumbing and electrical work may be needed before the cabinets go in. Ask whether each trade is included in the quote or priced separately, and whether waste removal, delivery and final adjustments are covered."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"How complexity changes the price"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A like-for-like replacement with services in the same positions is often simpler than changing the layout."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Moving a sink, dishwasher, cooker or radiator can require plumbing, drainage, gas or electrical work."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Removing a wall or opening the kitchen into another room can introduce structural, design and making-good costs."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Uneven floors, damaged walls, old wiring and concealed leaks may only become clear after the existing kitchen is removed."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Tight access, upper-floor delivery and limited parking can add time, so mention these constraints during the survey."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Materials: where your kitchen budget goes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Cabinet construction, door style and worktop material can have a substantial effect on the final price. Flat-pack or entry-level units can reduce the initial spend, while rigid cabinets, custom sizes and bespoke storage can increase it. Laminate worktops are often more economical than solid timber, quartz, granite or porcelain. Handles, sinks, taps, splashbacks and internal storage accessories can also add up, even when each individual choice seems modest."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Units and doors: these can be a significant product cost, especially with tall housings, pan drawers and made-to-measure cabinets."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktops: laminate is often a lower-cost option; timber and compact laminate may cost more, while stone and porcelain can require specialist templating and installation."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Appliances: allow for ovens, hobs, extraction, fridge-freezers, dishwashers and washing machines if they are being replaced rather than reused."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Finishes: include splashbacks, wall tiling, flooring, paint, lighting, sockets, handles, sinks and taps rather than treating them as afterthoughts."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Common extras to include in a London kitchen budget"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["A realistic budget should include more than the cabinets and basic installation. Flooring may need to continue into an adjoining dining or living area, and old plaster can require repair after units are removed. Extra sockets, under-cabinet lighting and upgraded extraction are generally easier to plan before the new kitchen is fitted. If you are considering a broader project, compare the scope with a professional ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/kitchen-renovation-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen renovation service"}]," rather than requesting a fitting-only price."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Removal and disposal of the old kitchen"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plastering, decorating and wall preparation"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Floor preparation, new flooring or levelling compound"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Additional sockets, lighting and consumer-unit or circuit work where required"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plumbing, drainage, radiator or gas alterations"]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktop templating, upstands, end panels and fitting"]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Building work, structural design and making good for open-plan layouts"]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Delivery, access equipment, parking costs and a contingency for hidden defects"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How to keep your kitchen fitting cost under control"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Start with a written scope that lists the layout, appliances, finishes and every trade required. Keeping the sink, cooker and dishwasher in their existing positions can reduce disruption, although it should not override a poor layout. Choose the worktop and appliances early because their dimensions affect cabinet planning. Obtain comparable quotations based on the same specification, check what is excluded and confirm whether prices include VAT. Consider setting aside a contingency, particularly in older properties where concealed pipework, wiring and uneven surfaces may need attention."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["For homeowners in Watford, Hertfordshire and nearby North London areas, BMB Renovation provides kitchen fitting and renovation, with plumbing, tiling, electrical and cabinet installation handled in-house. The company is based at 157 Judge Street, Watford WD24 5AN, and serves Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead, Borehamwood, Harrow, Croxley Green, Luton and Bedford. You can review the ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/kitchen-fitting-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen fitting service"}]," or request a ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/contact","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"free, no-obligation quote"}]," based on your actual room and specification."]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Get a Free, No-Obligation Quote"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation handles kitchens, bathrooms and full home renovations across Watford, Hertfordshire, North London & Bedfordshire — all trades in-house. Tell us about your project today."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get My Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-6","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"h